@* ===== About: purpose of the site + simple contact (mailto, no backend) ===== *@
<section class="section section--sand" id="about">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="split">
            <div class="split__text">
                <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
                <h2>About The Slow Road Armenia</h2>
                <p>
                    This is a simple, free guide for first-time visitors to Armenia. It is not a booking site
                    and it sells nothing — it just collects the places, facts and tips we wish we had known before
                    our first trip, on one page you can read on your phone.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Content is checked against official and reference sources, but prices, visa rules and
                    exchange rates change: always confirm the details that matter for your journey.
                </p>

                <div class="contact-box">
                    <h3>Get in touch</h3>
                    <p>Spotted a mistake or have a tip to share? Send us an email — there is no contact form on this site, just a plain mail link.</p>
                    <p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:hello@slowroadarmenia.com?subject=The%20Slow%20Road%20Armenia">Email hello@slowroadarmenia.com</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <figure>
                <img src="~/images/about.svg" alt="A winding mountain road through the Armenian highlands" />
            </figure>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Ready for the slow road?</h2>
        <p>Pick a season, pack good shoes, and let Armenia set the pace.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#destinations">Browse destinations</a>
    </div>
</section>
